#: src/ai/mcp.md:26
msgid ""
"in the app, open the Command Palette and run the `zed: extensions` action"
msgstr ""

#: src/ai/mcp.md:27
msgid ""
"in the app, go to the Agent Panel's top-right menu and look for the \"View "
"Server Extensions\" menu item"
msgstr ""

